    <!--
        WORK_TIME_*, PAY_PERIOD_*, EXCHANGE_RATE_* and TENANT_CURRENCY_* role-template grants
        were intentionally moved out of this file: those privilege codes are seeded by later modules
        (m7 currency, exchange-rate, m8 work-time, m9 pay-period) and DataGrantRoleTemplatePrivilege
        requires the privilege row to exist at run time. They live in per-module files that run after
        their respective privilege seeds. See data-m7-role-template-currency-privileges-1.xml,
        data-exchange-rate-role-template-privileges-1.xml,
        data-m8-role-template-work-time-privileges-1.xml,
